<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-106] Relax InputSplit Protections</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-106</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The new implementation of InputSplit is more restrictive with package and override permissions.  We need to relax these so we can override the InputSplit to subclass and allow for more advanced control of the splits (e.g. include partition information along with the split).&lt;/p&gt;

